{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":21,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 21:1"},"The king’s heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the hand of the LORD, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as "]},"the rivers of water: he turneth it whithersoever he will. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 21:2"},"Every way of a man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," right in his own eyes: but the LORD pondereth the hearts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 21:3"},"To do justice and judgment ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," more acceptable to the LORD than sacrifice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 21:4"},"An high look, and a proud heart, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the plowing of the wicked, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," sin. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 21:5"},"The thoughts of the diligent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["tend"]}," only to plenteousness; but of every one ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," hasty only to want. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 21:6"},"The getting of treasures by a lying tongue ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a vanity tossed to and fro of them that seek death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 21:7"},"The robbery of the wicked shall destroy them; because they refuse to do judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 21:8"},"The way of man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," froward and strange: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as for "]},"the pure, his work ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," right. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 21:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," better to dwell in a corner of the housetop, than with a brawling woman in a wide house. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 21:10"},"The soul of the wicked desireth evil: his neighbour findeth no favour in his eyes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 21:11"},"When the scorner is punished, the simple is made wise: and when the wise is instructed, he receiveth knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 21:12"},"The righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," wisely considereth the house of the wicked: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but God"]}," overthroweth the wicked for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their"]}," wickedness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 21:13"},"Whoso stoppeth his ears at the cry of the poor, he also shall cry himself, but shall not be heard. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 21:14"},"A gift in secret pacifieth anger: and a reward in the bosom strong wrath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 21:15"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," joy to the just to do judgment: but destruction ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," to the workers of iniquity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 21:16"},"The man that wandereth out of the way of understanding shall remain in the congregation of the dead. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 21:17"},"He that loveth pleasure ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," a poor man: he that loveth wine and oil shall not be rich. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 21:18"},"The wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," a ransom for the righteous, and the transgressor for the upright. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 21:19"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," better to dwell in the wilderness, than with a contentious and an angry woman. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 21:20"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," treasure to be desired and oil in the dwelling of the wise; but a foolish man spendeth it up. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 21:21"},"He that followeth after righteousness and mercy findeth life, righteousness, and honour. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 21:22"},"A wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," scaleth the city of the mighty, and casteth down the strength of the confidence thereof. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 21:23"},"Whoso keepeth his mouth and his tongue keepeth his soul from troubles. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 21:24"},"Proud ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," haughty scorner ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his name, who dealeth in proud wrath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 21:25"},"The desire of the slothful killeth him; for his hands refuse to labour. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 21:26"},"He coveteth greedily all the day long: but the righteous giveth and spareth not. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 21:27"},"The sacrifice of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," abomination: how much more, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," he bringeth it with a wicked mind? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 21:28"},"A false witness shall perish: but the man that heareth speaketh constantly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 21:29"},"A wicked man hardeneth his face: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as for"]}," the upright, he directeth his way. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 21:30"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," no wisdom nor understanding nor counsel against the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 21:31"},"The horse ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," prepared against the day of battle: but safety ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 21:31"}]}]}
